sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Repair
    participant W as Copies
    participant D as Docker
    participant C as Coord.
    participant A as Worker
    participant V as Verify
    F->>W: Create copies
    F->>D: Baseline tests
    D-->>F: Baseline evidence
    Note over F,W: Test failure required
    F->>C: Task and read tools
    C-->>F: Plan
    F->>A: Task, plan, latest feedback
    A->>W: Edit work copy
    A-->>F: Summary
    F->>W: Check and rebuild
    W-->>F: Patch and hashes
    F->>D: Candidate tests
    D-->>F: Status and output
    F->>V: Candidate and test evidence
    V-->>F: Review
    Note over F,W: Complete or retry
    F->>W: Remove temporary copies
    Note over F,W: Retain delivery evidence
